<title>POLAND: KPBP BICK WINS DM 3.1 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>KPBP BICK WINS DM 3.1 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm KPBP Bick SA has signed a 3.1-million-mark contract with Germany's Dechant Bau GmbH to build apartment buildings in Leipzig, Germany, Bick said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said work on the project would have to be completed by November 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
